# Agent documentation, its tooling and the frozen test fixtures are stored and checked out with
# LF on every platform: scripts/check-docs.mjs rejects CR in the documents, the hooks match
# patterns at line ends, and tests read fixtures by offset.
# Nothing else is listed on purpose. Source files and the sample documents keep whatever the
# checkout gives them.
AGENTS.md text eol=lf
CLAUDE.md text eol=lf
docs/** text eol=lf
.claude/** text eol=lf
scripts/check-docs.mjs text eol=lf
scripts/check-docs.test.mjs text eol=lf
test/fixtures/** text eol=lf
